WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:25.400
( Support Admin Watch on kissFlix.co )

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:49.030
[Genius Girlfriend]

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:51.890
[Episode 28]

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:56.350
How long until you leave?

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:57.560
A week.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:05.310
I'll come back when I'm on vacation.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.470
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:09.930
You can also come visit me.

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:14.780
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:17.240
I'll call you every day.

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:23.150
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:24.190
Are you upset?

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:34.100
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:41.690
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:48.050
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

00:02:48.829 --> 00:02:51.720
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:55.280
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.030
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:02.070
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.320
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.850
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:12.120
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:16.210
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.100
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.270
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:29.790
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.760
♪ Myself ♪

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.800
[Shui]

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:55.630
Dr. Shen.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.130
I've started a new round of treatment.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:00.770
The doctor said
this one is really important,

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.430
but it really hurts.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.870
And they use a lot of medical terms

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.330
in English, so I can barely

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.280
make sense of what they're saying.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.280
I'm totally lost.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:14.520
I told you to learn English ages ago,

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.850
but you thought it was too much trouble
and refused to learn.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.040
Can't you comfort me a little

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.160
when I'm already like this?

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.360
But I won't hold it against you.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.560
Let me tell you something.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.960
I'm about to be moved into
the sterile room.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:32.470
Does that mean

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.659
it'll soon be my turn to have surgery?

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.960
The nurse is urging me to go in

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.680
and won't let me bring my phone.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:42.720
But don't worry.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.200
I'll keep you posted.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.000
Bye.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:49.210
Stay strong.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.120
I'll be waiting for your good news.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.040
Tingting!

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:37.720
Duan Qiyan?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.120
W-Why are you here?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.320
What's with this car?

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.870
I borrowed it, of course.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:52.950
Hou Wei has been completely
at my beck and call lately.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.190
I asked him for a car,

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:55.750
and without a second thought,
he lent it to me right away.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:56.480
How is it?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:57.360
Isn't it cool?

00:05:59.159 --> 00:06:00.360
Cool my foot.

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:01.920
Don't you find it embarrassing?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.200
How is this embarrassing?

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.800
Of course I should make a big show of it

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:05.800
when I pick up my girlfriend from work.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:06.800
It's the most basic courtesy
and sense of ceremony

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.600
I should have as your boyfriend.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.360
Boyfriend?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:15.430
Hello.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.920
I'm Tingting's boyfriend, Duan Qiyan.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.410
Is it really necessary

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.240
to make such a big deal

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.120
out of something so small?

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:25.920
Of course it is.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.650
With a wife as wonderful as you,

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.600
I have to announce it to
the whole world, don't I?

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:32.740
Give it a rest already.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.010
We're right at the entrance of my office.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.680
Alright, you've worked hard today.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.240
Tell me what you want to eat,

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.440
and I'll take you out.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.390
Since there's someone else here
to pick you up, I'll get going then.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:50.720
Be safe on your way back.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.950
Alright, you too.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:52.720
Rest early.

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:55.390
Bye-bye.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:56.920
Bye-bye.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.310
Nice car.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.270
Isn't it?

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:10.070
What do you want to eat? Let's go.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.750
Something expensive.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:20.500
Hello, sir.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:20.560
[DR Engagement Ring]

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.000
How can I help you?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:24.500
I'd like to buy an engagement ring.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.870
[The Only One for Only You]

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.630
Do you have any unique designs?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.600
So what kind of girl

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.070
is your girlfriend?

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:34.430
She's like a star

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.670
that dispels the darkness
in the night sky.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:38.560
She's the most beautiful

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.560
and intelligent girl I've ever met.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:42.880
Once you've met her,

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:45.310
there's no room in your heart
for anyone else.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.120
You might want to take a look at

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:47.720
at our DR HEART collection.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.190
HEART stands for true love—

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:53.159
it allows you to give your most
sincere feelings to your partner.

00:07:53.159 --> 00:07:53.750
Plus,

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.240
our DR rings are meant to be given to
only one person in a lifetime

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.970
symbolizing your commitment
to loving only her.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:02.200
It's beautiful.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.050
I'll take this one.

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:03.130
[DR Engagement Ring]

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:03.390
Sure.

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:04.410
If you're sure you want this ring,

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:05.220
[The Only One for Only You]

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:07.880
you'll need to sign
this "True Love Agreement."

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:09.620
Please take a look.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.780
How's your packing going?

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:38.360
I'm almost done with
clothes and daily necessities.

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:40.360
Just a few small things left to pack.

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.510
I still have to go to the hospital
to pick up my medical exam results.

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:45.840
I'm running out of time.

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.550
I've prepared some common medicines
for you—

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.030
cold remedy, allergy medicine,
stomach medicine, etc.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:53.720
There are also

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.600
band-aids and disinfectant wipes
at the bottom.

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:56.550
I've labeled everything.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.510
If you can't find anything,
give me a call.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.120
When did you prepare all this?

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.510
I started preparing it when I found out

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.080
you were going to join a closed program.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:03.940
I also included

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.360
some chargers, adapters,

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.150
data cables, and stuff like that—

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.120
I packed 3 sets of each

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.250
in case you lose one.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.320
And a flashlight.

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.940
It'll come in handy
in case of a power outage.

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.770
I'm going to a closed experiment,

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:19.410
not going on a wilderness survival trip.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.650
I can buy all these at the base.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.180
Make sure to eat well

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.370
after I'm gone.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:37.700
Got it.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:51.530
Review your grad school prep materials

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:52.590
when you have time.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.890
Got it, Ms. Lin.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.130
There are also 2 warm sweaters.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:07.330
Make sure to bundle up when it gets cold.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.250
You don't have to worry about me
that much.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.050
Of course I'm worried about you.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.500
I'm just as worried about you

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.560
as you are about me.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.220
Alright, I promise you.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.290
After you leave,

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.650
I'll definitely take good care of myself,

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:25.620
eat well,

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:26.940
study hard,

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.740
and video call you every day to check in.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:31.010
I'll be the first to pick you up
when you get back,

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:32.700
and you can reach me anytime.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.580
I absolutely won't let you worry, Ms. Lin.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:28.140
Jiang Yubai, do you have time tomorrow?

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:31.800
Let's get married.

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:37.700
Are you serious?

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:43.510
Of course I am.

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:50.990
You've come such a long way on your own,

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.330
and I don't want you to be all alone again

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:56.500
after I'm gone.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.130
Just thinking about you
being all by yourself

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.340
makes me so sad.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.650
Once we're married,

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.270
you'll have me,

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:08.460
Zeqiu,

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:09.700
and my parents.

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:12.330
Then you won't be alone anymore.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.890
No matter where you are
or what you're doing,

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:17.220
there will always be someone by your side.

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:20.890
I want to entrust you to them,

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.860
and I also want to entrust them to you.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:27.740
I...

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:30.500
I still have a lot to prepare.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.010
Like the rings, flowers,

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:34.610
pre-wedding photos, and...

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:35.930
No need to prepare.

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:40.910
You don't need to prepare anything.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:45.480
I just want us to become a family

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:48.620
before I leave.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.900
Can I take you to a place tonight?

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.370
Su Mo.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.150
What are you doing here?

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:27.410
Tingting.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.060
I have something to tell you.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:32.460
What is it?

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:41.890
I've been thinking about something
for quite a while.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:51.010
I've decided to switch to Ms. Zhou's team.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.370
We were working together just fine.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.830
Why did you suddenly decide
to switch teams?

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.700
I have to.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.980
I don't know how to face you.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.770
You don't know how to face me?

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:11.130
Why?

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.130
It's not your fault.

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:15.170
It's mine.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:17.410
When I saw you with another guy,

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.410
I got really mad.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.460
I couldn't even

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.940
control my own emotions.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.870
I didn't know how to face you

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:23.670
or how to

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.340
manage my feelings.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.130
I don't want my emotions

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.580
to affect your life

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.410
or our work together,

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.620
so I've decided to leave.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.100
It's for the best for both of us.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:46.740
Tingting.

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.830
You're the best agent
I've ever worked with.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.410
If one day I come to terms with things

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:56.700
and let go,

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:01.990
I'll definitely reach out to you
to work together again.

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:09.140
I respect your decision,

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.320
and you're always welcome
to come back to me.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.250
Then...

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.500
I'll be leaving now.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.370
No matter what Zhou arranges for you,

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.500
remember this:

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.700
acting well is the foundation
of your career.

00:15:57.980 --> 00:16:00.980
When you're surrounded by distractions
that threaten to blind you, you need to

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.860
stay clear-headed and never lose sight of
your original purpose.

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:06.060
Otherwise, the higher you climb,
the harder you'll fall.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.750
Su Mo, keep working hard
and give it your all.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.170
Rest assured, Tingting.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.460
I'll do my best.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:35.410
How are you handling the news

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:37.310
that Su Mo is switching teams?

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:41.740
Although you've personally mentored him
from the start,

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:43.740
switching teams was his own request.

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:44.820
As a company,

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.020
we should respect the artist's choice.

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:49.550
I believe you can understand that, right?

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:54.700
But I've always recognized

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.980
your personal abilities

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:57.770
and your contributions to the company.

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:58.890
So today,

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.650
I have something to announce.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:05.900
Starting today,

00:17:06.089 --> 00:17:08.020
you'll be in charge of Agent Team 2.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.310
So you're now the head of Agent Team 2.

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:17.290
Thank you, Mr. Li, and thank you
to the company for your trust.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:18.530
I'll continue to work hard

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:20.260
and strive for better results.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.290
All right.

00:17:21.569 --> 00:17:23.609
Going forward, get to know the colleagues
in Team Two better

00:17:23.609 --> 00:17:25.410
and communicate with them more.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.010
Work steadily to move Team 2's projects

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:27.940
forward.

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:29.420
If you run into any difficulties

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:30.570
or need any help,

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.970
just let me know anytime.

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.500
Mr. Li, since you said

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:39.010
I could bring up any requests
whenever I have them,

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:41.410
I might as well just get it
out of the way now.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.090
Alright, go ahead and tell me.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:44.290
There's a young lady
in the Planning Department

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.140
named Min.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.420
She's very skilled at script planning.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.280
Could you transfer her to my team?

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:50.610
Sure. Coordinate with
the Planning Department

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:52.570
and have her transferred directly
to your team.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:53.770
Also,

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:55.290
regarding new media...

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:58.900
Just lay it all out at once.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:01.900
Regarding new media,

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:03.180
I'd like to hire one more person,
mainly responsible for

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.010
managing and following up on
the artists' short-video content.

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:06.940
Internally,

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.570
I won't compete with Team 1
for new talent.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:09.900
But for external projects,

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.500
do you think it'd be possible
for the artists from both Team 1 and 2

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.700
to meet with them at the same time?

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.330
We have to treat everyone fairly,
after all.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:15.180
I don't have a problem with that.

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:18.440
I'm just worried about
how the artists might feel about it.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:19.700
Everything else is fine.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.760
That's all for now.

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:24.850
You "don't have a problem with that"?

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:25.900
And "that's all"?

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.420
You're fighting for resources
and grabbing people left and right.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.020
I'm just doing this
for the good of the company.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:34.380
Alright.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.740
I'll give you everyone you asked for,

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.940
and from now on, I'll notify you
whenever there are major projects.

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:39.870
Is that settled?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.140
Thank you, Mr. Li.

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.090
I'll definitely keep working hard.

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:43.900
Keep it up.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:00.660
Jiang Yubai, I've arrived. Where are you?

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:06.610
[Jiang Yubai]

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:08.210
Go wait for me under the tree.

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:09.350
I'll be right there.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:46.610
L-L-L-L-Lin Zhixia.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:47.440
Hello.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:49.720
Today, I want to tell you a story.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.710
A story about a little boy.

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:54.750
Jiang

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:58.570
has been a proud and sensitive boy
since childhood.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.410
He's highly competitive

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.880
and consistently ranked first
in every subject—

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.140
until he transferred schools
in fourth grade

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.480
and met a girl he could never beat:

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:09.330
Lin Zhixia.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.200
Do you remember?

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.770
Jiang's an expert at
folding paper airplanes.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:31.530
He even won first place
in a paper airplane contest once.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.750
The paper airplanes he folded
had a kind of magic.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.070
It was as if they were equipped with
a built-in navigation system,

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.730
able to find Lin Zhixia
with pinpoint accuracy.

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:43.240
And there was another hidden feature.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.950
When the paper airplane
flew toward Lin Zhixia,

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:51.090
it served as Jiang's opening line,

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:54.310
conveying his desire to get closer to her

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:58.300
on his behalf when he didn't know
how to start the conversation.

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:21.720
[Become a genius like Lin Zhixia]

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.400
He liked Lin Zhixia,

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:31.400
yet he also wanted to beat her—

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:32.750
these two emotions

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.600
were constantly at odds
in Jiang Yubai's mind.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:39.090
Perhaps that was just
the conflict of adolescence.

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:40.320
Sometimes, he'd even dream

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.450
[Become a genius like Lin Zhixia]

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:41.590
[Become best friends with Jiang Yubai]

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:43.070
that he had come in first place.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.110
And in the dream, he'd comfort Lin Zhixia.

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:47.380
It's just that
I don't want to win because of you.

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:50.910
And even less do I want to be known as
the teammate of some genius.

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:53.360
I'd always been number one

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:55.260
when you were not in the picture.

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:58.090
And I want to see just how big the gap
between us really is

00:21:58.090 --> 00:22:00.090
when we compete against each other.

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.590
But at some point,

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:04.310
[The 6th Nanhai Provincial Symposium
on Marine Science Development]

00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:06.110
he stopped feeling conflicted.

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:08.640
He accepted that the person he liked

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:09.770
was better than him.

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:12.850
Even if all he could do
was look up to her,

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:13.680
support her,

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:15.770
and stay by her side,

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:17.700
he was still happy.

00:22:18.590 --> 00:22:19.920
No matter when or where,

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:22.460
Lin Zhixia would always be number one

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:24.660
in Jiang Yubai's heart.

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:47.070
That night,

00:22:48.590 --> 00:22:49.660
Jiang Yubai and Lin Zhixia

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:51.550
talked a lot about the universe.

00:22:52.990 --> 00:22:53.700
They even planned

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:57.160
to take a picture with
the Sirius starlight from 8.6 years ago.

00:22:57.960 --> 00:22:59.690
Lin Zhixia probably had no idea

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:02.710
how frustrated Jiang Yubai was
at the time—

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:04.800
why his hands kept shaking,

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:08.880
and why he hadn't adjusted
the camera settings properly.

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:10.270
Fortunately, on the bus,

00:23:10.270 --> 00:23:13.310
[Happiness Is Actually So Simple]

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:16.570
when Lin Zhixia fell asleep
leaning against his shoulder,

00:23:17.240 --> 00:23:19.840
Jiang Yubai took
another shot of them together

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:22.950
and has cherished it like a treasure
ever since.

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:25.280
I did the math.

00:23:26.310 --> 00:23:28.510
The light emitted by Sirius at that time

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:31.050
might have reached Earth by now,

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.840
and Jiang Yubai and Lin Zhixia

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:36.960
are still together.

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:49.640
Jiang Yubai often asks himself a question:

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:52.770
Is he a lucky person or not?

00:23:54.400 --> 00:23:56.330
It seems that throughout his life,

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:59.220
sudden upheavals have always

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:01.830
disrupted his peaceful existence.

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:04.290
But he feels fortunate.

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:08.890
Perhaps all the bad things
that have happened to him

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:11.610
have been redeemed by
one huge stroke of luck:

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:14.300
being chosen by the fallen leaf.

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:16.700
The odds of that happening

00:24:16.750 --> 00:24:18.460
are as slim as a tossed coin

00:24:18.490 --> 00:24:20.490
landing upright in a crack in a rock,

00:24:21.010 --> 00:24:23.770
as rare as two people meeting
in a vast crowd,

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:28.940
or as unlikely as the person you like
happening to like you back.

00:24:31.640 --> 00:24:33.170
That bet under the big tree—

00:24:34.720 --> 00:24:35.780
he was lucky enough

00:24:36.810 --> 00:24:37.530
to lose it.

00:24:39.710 --> 00:24:40.660
All along,

00:24:41.250 --> 00:24:43.980
Jiang Yubai has been a boy
who never quite grew up.

00:24:44.010 --> 00:24:45.140
He's made mistakes,

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:48.270
had doubts, and lost his way.

00:24:49.590 --> 00:24:52.050
But fortunately, Lin Zhixia
has always been there

00:24:52.050 --> 00:24:55.070
to pull him back to her side
time and time again.

00:24:56.010 --> 00:24:57.940
As long as Lin Zhixia is by his side,

00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:02.940
Jiang Yubai has the courage
to face anything.

00:25:22.460 --> 00:25:24.640
L-L-L-L-Lin Zhixia.

00:25:48.250 --> 00:25:56.060
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

00:25:57.030 --> 00:26:01.650
♪ One second of encounter,
heartstrings stirred ♪

00:26:02.250 --> 00:26:05.380
♪ The story feels altogether different ♪

00:26:07.800 --> 00:26:15.370
♪ How to describe
my whimsical wandering dream? ♪

00:26:16.440 --> 00:26:21.100
♪ You softly answer my quirky side ♪

00:26:21.440 --> 00:26:24.620
♪ Such bliss to finally be understood ♪

00:26:25.860 --> 00:26:26.850
♪ The moon drifts past the window ♪

00:26:26.850 --> 00:26:27.660
Actually,

00:26:30.180 --> 00:26:30.850
I've been secretly preparing for today
for a long time.

00:26:30.850 --> 00:26:34.240
♪ How am I to understand? ♪

00:26:34.240 --> 00:26:35.110
I always wanted

00:26:35.730 --> 00:26:36.440
♪ About you ♪

00:26:36.440 --> 00:26:37.920
to make it even prettier

00:26:38.110 --> 00:26:39.590
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

00:26:39.590 --> 00:26:41.050
and be even more prepared.

00:26:43.060 --> 00:26:43.110
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

00:26:43.110 --> 00:26:44.240
But I never expected

00:26:45.590 --> 00:26:47.830
that you'd say the words
I wanted to say to you

00:26:47.830 --> 00:26:48.510
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

00:26:48.510 --> 00:26:49.720
ahead of time today.

00:26:51.730 --> 00:26:52.480
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

00:26:52.480 --> 00:26:53.480
So this time,

00:26:54.500 --> 00:26:55.500
you've won again.

00:26:57.240 --> 00:27:00.250
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

00:27:00.250 --> 00:27:00.790
So...

00:27:02.260 --> 00:27:03.070
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

00:27:03.070 --> 00:27:04.400
What did you want to say?

00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:07.160
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

00:27:07.160 --> 00:27:08.160
I wanted to say...

00:27:10.680 --> 00:27:10.700
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

00:27:10.700 --> 00:27:11.400
Lin Zhixia,

00:27:13.720 --> 00:27:15.750
I want to be your best friend

00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:18.570
and family forever.

00:27:26.010 --> 00:27:27.070
Let's get married.

00:27:30.070 --> 00:27:30.880
Jiang Yubai

00:27:31.500 --> 00:27:33.100
will always love Lin Zhixia.

00:27:36.680 --> 00:27:37.500
♪ Drifting along the path,
drifting through spring and winter ♪

00:27:37.500 --> 00:27:38.220
Lin Zhixia

00:27:39.590 --> 00:27:42.070
will also always love Jiang Yubai.

00:27:45.350 --> 00:27:49.490
♪ As the pen moves across the paper,
the words become blurred ♪

00:27:50.000 --> 00:27:53.910
♪ At this moment, you feel so real
yet like a dream ♪

00:27:54.860 --> 00:27:58.340
♪ The moon drifts past the window ♪

00:27:59.830 --> 00:28:03.470
♪ How am I supposed to understand? ♪

00:28:04.480 --> 00:28:05.650
♪ About you ♪

00:28:06.860 --> 00:28:11.200
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

00:28:11.870 --> 00:28:16.140
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

00:28:16.670 --> 00:28:19.730
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

00:28:20.320 --> 00:28:25.580
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

00:28:25.910 --> 00:28:30.490
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

00:28:30.930 --> 00:28:35.460
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

00:28:35.660 --> 00:28:38.750
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

00:28:39.340 --> 00:28:45.040
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

00:28:57.590 --> 00:28:58.400
Dr. Shen.

00:28:59.480 --> 00:29:00.310
Hello.

00:29:01.640 --> 00:29:02.590
I'm sorry

00:29:03.070 --> 00:29:05.870
that I can't say goodbye to you
in person this time.

00:29:09.240 --> 00:29:11.440
By the time you hear this voice message,

00:29:12.440 --> 00:29:14.900
I'll probably have already
left this world.

00:29:17.680 --> 00:29:18.790
I was very happy

00:29:19.830 --> 00:29:21.200
in the time I had left.

00:29:24.000 --> 00:29:25.270
Thank you for fighting for

00:29:25.270 --> 00:29:27.070
every chance at treatment for me.

00:29:27.070 --> 00:29:28.650
And thank you for giving me

00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:31.880
so much courage and hope.

00:29:32.000 --> 00:29:33.790
Dr. Shen, look.

00:29:34.070 --> 00:29:35.800
There are already 20 stickers.

00:29:36.920 --> 00:29:38.380
I'll always remember you.

00:29:39.720 --> 00:29:41.000
I'll remember you too.

00:29:43.960 --> 00:29:44.750
Dr. Shen.

00:29:45.440 --> 00:29:47.790
You are truly a wonderful person.

00:29:48.350 --> 00:29:49.680
You deserve to be loved

00:29:51.030 --> 00:29:53.350
and have the very best life.

00:29:55.110 --> 00:29:58.110
So please, live your life happily

00:29:58.590 --> 00:30:01.400
and to the fullest.

00:30:03.670 --> 00:30:04.760
[Hematology Department, Shen Fuxuan]

00:30:06.510 --> 00:30:07.240
I'm leaving,

00:30:07.810 --> 00:30:08.610
Dr. Shen.

00:30:13.350 --> 00:30:14.160
Shui...

00:30:34.450 --> 00:30:37.790
[Hematology Department, Shen Fuxuan]

00:31:20.140 --> 00:31:21.750
While I was away,

00:31:22.440 --> 00:31:24.460
Jiang Yubai worked

00:31:25.270 --> 00:31:28.130
while poring over
his particle physics textbooks.

00:31:29.420 --> 00:31:30.240
I know

00:31:31.030 --> 00:31:34.310
he wasn't just preparing for
the graduate school entrance exam.

00:31:34.310 --> 00:31:35.840
He was using those formulas

00:31:36.330 --> 00:31:38.260
to fill the void left by my absence,

00:31:38.850 --> 00:31:40.770
catching up on the time

00:31:41.200 --> 00:31:44.330
slowed down by debt
with every late-night calculation.

00:31:45.680 --> 00:31:46.750
He wanted to become

00:31:46.940 --> 00:31:49.070
someone who could stand
shoulder to shoulder with me—

00:31:49.070 --> 00:31:50.200
not looking up to me,

00:31:50.420 --> 00:31:51.980
not following in my footsteps,

00:31:51.980 --> 00:31:54.780
but a lover who could
stand on equal ground with me.

00:31:56.900 --> 00:31:59.350
Shen Fuxuan devoted all his time to work.

00:32:00.440 --> 00:32:01.720
We could roughly guess

00:32:01.980 --> 00:32:03.310
what he'd been through,

00:32:03.850 --> 00:32:04.450
but no one asked.

00:32:04.450 --> 00:32:05.920
[Hematology Department]

00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:07.010
Some wounds

00:32:07.960 --> 00:32:10.550
heal best when left to mend in silence.

00:32:13.270 --> 00:32:14.610
Zeqiu and Jin Baihui's

00:32:16.000 --> 00:32:17.050
married life

00:32:17.070 --> 00:32:19.470
was as calm and steady
as a cup of warm water.

00:32:19.940 --> 00:32:21.420
Though their courtship was brief,

00:32:21.420 --> 00:32:22.680
it felt as though

00:32:22.750 --> 00:32:25.010
they'd been together their whole lives.

00:32:26.440 --> 00:32:28.180
Tang Tingting and Duan Qiyan

00:32:29.420 --> 00:32:31.570
finally took their friends' bickering

00:32:31.570 --> 00:32:33.850
and turned it into
the playful quarrels of a couple.

00:32:33.850 --> 00:32:34.510
Look.

00:32:35.860 --> 00:32:36.090
[Starring: Su Mo]

00:32:36.090 --> 00:32:36.830
It hasn't been long,

00:32:36.830 --> 00:32:37.110
and Su Mo's already starring in a movie.

00:32:37.110 --> 00:32:38.740
[The loneliness of a genius is
the ultimate romance beyond understanding]

00:32:38.740 --> 00:32:39.870
As the lead, no less.

00:32:39.960 --> 00:32:41.420
[Genius and Magic]
[In Theaters Now]

00:32:41.420 --> 00:32:44.090
His name stands out,

00:32:44.090 --> 00:32:45.420
and he's in a great spot.

00:32:45.700 --> 00:32:48.430
It's just that he's not exactly
a box office draw.

00:32:56.290 --> 00:32:57.330
I mean, his acting is solid,

00:32:57.330 --> 00:32:59.090
and he's got a really expressive gaze.

00:32:59.090 --> 00:33:00.420
He's definitely got what it takes
to become an award-winning actor.

00:33:00.420 --> 00:33:01.530
Ouch. It hurts.

00:33:01.980 --> 00:33:03.140
That's more like it.

00:33:03.560 --> 00:33:05.620
When have my standards ever been off?

00:33:09.180 --> 00:33:10.780
You're not wrong about that.

00:33:11.250 --> 00:33:14.180
If your standards were bad,
would you have chosen me?

00:33:15.420 --> 00:33:16.350
Shameless.

00:33:18.740 --> 00:33:20.010
Don't go. Wait for me.

00:33:25.130 --> 00:33:29.720
[6 months later]

00:33:33.920 --> 00:33:34.530
Finally.

00:33:36.220 --> 00:33:38.940
[Letter of Admission]

00:33:55.810 --> 00:33:56.610
I'm home.

00:33:56.810 --> 00:33:58.010
Welcome home, honey.

00:33:59.660 --> 00:34:01.180
What did you bring back this time?

00:34:01.180 --> 00:34:02.380
The things Mom and Dad gave us last time

00:34:02.380 --> 00:34:04.140
are still sitting in the fridge.
We haven't even finished them yet.

00:34:04.140 --> 00:34:05.740
These aren't those things.

00:34:05.980 --> 00:34:08.210
These are some old items from home.

00:34:08.860 --> 00:34:10.860
Mom and Dad were insisting on
throwing them away as junk,

00:34:10.860 --> 00:34:12.130
but I thought it would be a shame
to toss them,

00:34:12.130 --> 00:34:13.389
so I brought them back.

00:34:13.500 --> 00:34:14.940
I didn't know you liked this kind of stuff
as a kid,

00:34:14.940 --> 00:34:15.940
little princess.

00:34:16.210 --> 00:34:17.130
It's not mine.

00:34:17.130 --> 00:34:18.380
It's Lin Zhixia's.

00:34:18.780 --> 00:34:20.420
Lin Zhixia's been gone
for almost a year now.

00:34:20.420 --> 00:34:21.750
When is she coming back?

00:34:22.380 --> 00:34:23.170
No idea.

00:34:23.300 --> 00:34:24.760
It should be soon, though.

00:34:28.810 --> 00:34:29.969
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

00:34:33.230 --> 00:34:34.840
Don't look at this. Don't.

00:34:37.929 --> 00:34:41.480
[Everything has cracks;
that's where the light gets in.]

00:34:42.130 --> 00:34:42.860
Please

00:34:43.940 --> 00:34:45.600
pass this to Lin Zhixia for me.

00:34:46.860 --> 00:34:47.790
Leave this to me.

00:34:49.730 --> 00:34:50.590
I'll handle it.

00:34:52.650 --> 00:34:53.780
Is this my book?

00:34:57.210 --> 00:34:58.740
You glued it back together.

00:34:59.090 --> 00:35:00.210
I thought it was a great book,

00:35:00.210 --> 00:35:02.140
and it'd be a waste to throw it away.

00:35:06.720 --> 00:35:11.540
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

00:35:14.090 --> 00:35:14.980
Lin Zeqiu.

00:35:16.070 --> 00:35:19.300
Don't tell me
that you've had a crush on me

00:35:19.300 --> 00:35:20.610
since back then.

00:35:23.900 --> 00:35:24.780
No.

00:35:25.090 --> 00:35:25.860
That's not the case.

00:35:25.860 --> 00:35:26.860
Be honest with me.

00:35:26.940 --> 00:35:29.130
I'm honest. We were both too young
back then.

00:35:29.130 --> 00:35:30.820
-Give it to me.
-But you glued it back so nicely.

00:35:30.820 --> 00:35:31.420
It's not like that.

00:35:31.420 --> 00:35:32.500
Every piece is there.

00:35:32.500 --> 00:35:36.160
-Every piece looks so carefully restored.
-It's not like that...

00:35:38.010 --> 00:35:38.780
Lin Zeqiu.

00:35:41.780 --> 00:35:44.040
Thank you for finding me, piece by piece,

00:35:44.780 --> 00:35:46.440
and putting me back together.

00:35:55.830 --> 00:36:03.780
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

00:36:25.090 --> 00:36:31.440
[3 years later]

00:36:31.570 --> 00:36:33.550
Now, let's welcome the principal

00:36:33.650 --> 00:36:33.670
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

00:36:33.670 --> 00:36:35.440
to present commemorative medals
to outstanding alumni

00:36:35.440 --> 00:36:35.590
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

00:36:35.590 --> 00:36:37.720
including Lin Zhixia and Jiang Yubai.

00:36:44.960 --> 00:36:46.420
At this moment, we'd especially like to

00:36:46.420 --> 00:36:47.880
introduce 2 outstanding alumni:

00:36:47.880 --> 00:36:50.210
Lin Zhixia and Jiang Yubai.

00:36:50.210 --> 00:36:51.420
They are both distinguished scientists

00:36:51.420 --> 00:36:52.980
who graduated from our No. 1 High School,

00:36:52.980 --> 00:36:54.650
each achieving remarkable accomplishments

00:36:54.650 --> 00:36:56.900
in the fields of mathematics and physics.

00:36:56.900 --> 00:36:58.980
They are not only
a husband-and-wife pair of scientists,

00:36:58.980 --> 00:37:00.860
but also each other's

00:37:00.900 --> 00:37:00.950
closest classmates,

00:37:00.950 --> 00:37:01.770
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

00:37:01.790 --> 00:37:02.610
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

00:37:02.610 --> 00:37:04.340
dearest friends, and lifelong partners.

00:37:04.340 --> 00:37:05.580
Once again, let's give our applause

00:37:05.580 --> 00:37:05.820
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

00:37:05.820 --> 00:37:06.890
to all of our outstanding alumni.

00:37:06.890 --> 00:37:08.370
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

00:37:18.610 --> 00:37:20.010
I'm the one giving the speech again.

00:37:20.010 --> 00:37:22.140
You always dump this kind of work on me.

00:37:22.690 --> 00:37:25.950
It can't be helped.
You're the boss in our family after all.

00:37:26.170 --> 00:37:27.170
Don't be nervous.

00:37:27.210 --> 00:37:28.940
I'll be right there beside you.

00:37:29.380 --> 00:37:31.460
Next, please welcome Lin Zhixia,

00:37:31.460 --> 00:37:33.090
representing our outstanding alumni,

00:37:33.090 --> 00:37:34.130
to give a speech.

00:37:34.340 --> 00:37:35.090
Please.

00:37:42.770 --> 00:37:46.770
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

00:37:46.800 --> 00:37:48.610
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

00:37:48.610 --> 00:37:49.610
Hello, everyone.

00:37:49.900 --> 00:37:50.900
I'm Lin Zhixia.

00:37:52.170 --> 00:37:53.210
Thank you to my alma mater

00:37:53.210 --> 00:37:54.610
for giving me this honor.

00:37:55.820 --> 00:37:57.680
I'm by no means a model of success.

00:37:58.050 --> 00:37:59.130
I'm simply a fellow traveler

00:37:59.130 --> 00:38:01.660
on everyone's journey of
seeking knowledge.

00:38:02.980 --> 00:38:04.900
I'm deeply grateful to my teachers.

00:38:04.900 --> 00:38:07.090
Through their own actions, they taught me

00:38:07.090 --> 00:38:08.940
not to be afraid to ask questions—

00:38:08.940 --> 00:38:10.420
no matter how simple

00:38:10.460 --> 00:38:11.300
or naive

00:38:11.500 --> 00:38:12.380
they may seem.

00:38:13.530 --> 00:38:15.090
Many great discoveries

00:38:15.130 --> 00:38:16.460
begin with a question

00:38:16.500 --> 00:38:18.170
that others have overlooked.

00:38:18.210 --> 00:38:19.010
Class,

00:38:19.090 --> 00:38:19.260
let's give a round of applause

00:38:19.260 --> 00:38:20.260
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

00:38:20.260 --> 00:38:22.570
to Lin Zhixia to cheer her up.

00:38:23.190 --> 00:38:24.290
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

00:38:28.980 --> 00:38:30.180
Thank you, Director.

00:38:30.230 --> 00:38:30.960
All the best.

00:38:31.480 --> 00:38:32.540
I know you can do it.

00:38:33.730 --> 00:38:35.590
I'd also like to thank my friends.

00:38:36.590 --> 00:38:38.050
They've helped me realize

00:38:38.150 --> 00:38:40.550
that on the journey of
exploring the world,

00:38:40.550 --> 00:38:42.280
in addition to cold, hard data,

00:38:42.320 --> 00:38:44.650
we also need the warmth of companionship.

00:38:45.150 --> 00:38:47.400
We may go on to pursue different paths,

00:38:48.550 --> 00:38:51.400
but it's precisely this kind of
support and companionship

00:38:51.400 --> 00:38:53.030
that has built

00:38:53.190 --> 00:38:55.190
the strongest emotional foundation
between us.

00:38:55.190 --> 00:38:57.110
Aiming for first place
in the entire province.

00:38:57.110 --> 00:38:57.960
Deal.

00:38:58.000 --> 00:38:58.840
Deal.

00:38:58.960 --> 00:38:59.800
Deal.

00:39:08.480 --> 00:39:09.740
May our friendship...

00:39:09.800 --> 00:39:11.800
-Last forever!
-Last forever!

00:39:20.070 --> 00:39:21.870
I'd also like to thank my family.

00:39:22.230 --> 00:39:23.360
Although they don't know

00:39:23.360 --> 00:39:25.230
what a Hilbert space is

00:39:25.510 --> 00:39:27.570
or what quantum entanglement means,

00:39:27.630 --> 00:39:29.590
they've constructed

00:39:29.710 --> 00:39:31.320
an absolutely stable reference frame

00:39:31.320 --> 00:39:33.320
for me in the simplest possible way.

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:34.230
Zhixia.

00:39:35.000 --> 00:39:36.360
We hope

00:39:37.110 --> 00:39:39.230
you can do what you want to do,

00:39:40.070 --> 00:39:42.150
see the scenery you want to see,

00:39:43.070 --> 00:39:44.930
and live the life you want to live.

00:39:45.320 --> 00:39:47.150
That's our biggest wish.

00:39:49.840 --> 00:39:51.440
I'd like to thank my husband.

00:39:52.110 --> 00:39:53.000
For

00:39:53.150 --> 00:39:54.630
helping me find

00:39:55.110 --> 00:39:57.320
my own way to connect with this world

00:39:57.710 --> 00:39:59.320
with infinite patience.

00:40:02.110 --> 00:40:03.150
In the universe,

00:40:03.510 --> 00:40:05.910
there's a remarkable celestial structure

00:40:06.030 --> 00:40:07.630
called a binary star system.

00:40:08.480 --> 00:40:09.940
Though they differ in mass

00:40:09.960 --> 00:40:11.110
and have distinct orbits,

00:40:11.110 --> 00:40:12.840
they revolve around each other

00:40:12.960 --> 00:40:14.020
and move together.

00:40:14.590 --> 00:40:15.670
Just like us,

00:40:16.400 --> 00:40:19.070
each going about our own lives
yet watching over one another,

00:40:19.070 --> 00:40:21.190
holding fast to our love for life

00:40:21.440 --> 00:40:23.300
and our commitment to each other.

00:40:25.050 --> 00:40:26.010
Jiang Yubai

00:40:26.550 --> 00:40:28.150
will always love Lin Zhixia.

00:40:28.960 --> 00:40:29.800
Lin Zhixia

00:40:30.690 --> 00:40:33.000
will also always love Jiang Yubai.

00:40:34.900 --> 00:40:36.550
You are like the last anchor

00:40:37.050 --> 00:40:39.010
that keeps me steady in this world.

00:40:39.840 --> 00:40:40.630
Thank you

00:40:41.860 --> 00:40:43.120
for not giving up on me.

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:46.530
Jiang Yubai, do you know
about time capsules?

00:40:46.730 --> 00:40:48.210
Let's write down our wishes

00:40:48.210 --> 00:40:49.260
and come back and open them together

00:40:49.260 --> 00:40:50.860
when we enter middle school.

00:40:52.170 --> 00:40:53.960
Jiang Yubai, I declare that

00:40:54.190 --> 00:40:56.590
from now on,
you're my binary star partner.

00:40:58.170 --> 00:41:00.630
Finally, I'd like to share this
with you all:

00:41:01.420 --> 00:41:02.210
life

00:41:02.570 --> 00:41:05.460
is a token of the future
entrusted to time.

00:41:06.130 --> 00:41:07.530
For each of us, the future

00:41:07.690 --> 00:41:09.950
is not a destination we passively await,

00:41:10.260 --> 00:41:11.940
but a fluid reality

00:41:12.050 --> 00:41:14.580
shaped by every action we take
in the present.

00:41:15.170 --> 00:41:15.980
Therefore,

00:41:16.500 --> 00:41:19.420
the future is both the result
of our present choices

00:41:19.980 --> 00:41:22.050
and the light we project ahead.

00:41:25.690 --> 00:41:27.780
Life across the ages is like
a journey against the current;

00:41:27.780 --> 00:41:30.910
the future through the ages
is like a harmonious melody.

00:41:31.130 --> 00:41:32.460
I wish all of you

00:41:32.820 --> 00:41:33.940
to cherish today,

00:41:34.090 --> 00:41:35.260
seize the moment,

00:41:35.900 --> 00:41:37.570
live in harmony with the future,

00:41:37.570 --> 00:41:39.700
and fully embrace the freedom of life.

00:41:40.300 --> 00:41:41.210
Thank you all.

00:42:38.610 --> 00:42:40.500
♪ Warm fishbowl ♪

00:42:41.370 --> 00:42:43.210
♪ Glass sprouts forth ♪

00:42:43.570 --> 00:42:45.520
♪ Drowning at dusk ♪

00:42:46.340 --> 00:42:47.960
♪ You come to save me ♪

00:42:48.380 --> 00:42:50.190
♪ Such oddities ♪

00:42:51.230 --> 00:42:53.030
♪ Bizarre dreams ♪

00:42:53.410 --> 00:42:55.250
♪ You call them ♪

00:42:56.480 --> 00:42:57.830
♪ Déjà vu ♪

00:42:58.340 --> 00:42:59.190
♪ A random cut-in ♪

00:42:59.190 --> 00:43:00.710
This is my story.

00:43:00.900 --> 00:43:01.480
♪ 2013 ♪

00:43:01.480 --> 00:43:03.010
A story of formulas and intuition,

00:43:03.010 --> 00:43:03.940
♪ 16 times faster ♪

00:43:03.940 --> 00:43:05.230
reason and emotion,

00:43:05.730 --> 00:43:05.950
solitude and embrace.

00:43:05.950 --> 00:43:07.780
♪ The night is like a window ♪

00:43:08.150 --> 00:43:08.690
♪ The night is like the sea ♪

00:43:08.690 --> 00:43:09.460
I believe

00:43:09.920 --> 00:43:10.740
there must be countless others like me

00:43:10.740 --> 00:43:12.010
♪ Also like all the memories ♪

00:43:12.010 --> 00:43:13.820
scattered across this world.

00:43:14.900 --> 00:43:15.960
Perhaps right now,

00:43:16.070 --> 00:43:16.230
you're buried in a lab,

00:43:16.230 --> 00:43:17.740
♪ Frozen in frame ♪

00:43:17.970 --> 00:43:18.920
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

00:43:18.920 --> 00:43:20.610
perhaps you're lost in code,

00:43:20.610 --> 00:43:22.380
♪ Your heart is ♪

00:43:22.380 --> 00:43:22.720
or perhaps

00:43:22.720 --> 00:43:23.480
♪ A rotten one ♪

00:43:23.480 --> 00:43:25.470
you're trying to understand
this complex and fascinating world

00:43:25.470 --> 00:43:26.320
♪ Silently fading ♪

00:43:26.320 --> 00:43:27.860
through some unique language of your own.

00:43:27.860 --> 00:43:30.020
♪ Vanishing without a trace ♪

00:43:30.540 --> 00:43:31.510
♪ I walked in ♪

00:43:31.510 --> 00:43:32.690
I dedicate this story

00:43:32.690 --> 00:43:33.340
♪ But couldn't find ♪

00:43:33.340 --> 00:43:35.010
to each of you who, like me,

00:43:35.010 --> 00:43:35.820
♪ The exit ♪

00:43:35.820 --> 00:43:37.530
persist in pursuing romance
through reason;

00:43:37.530 --> 00:43:39.430
♪ You dwell within ♪

00:43:39.570 --> 00:43:40.180
and to each of you
who, though different from me,

00:43:40.180 --> 00:43:41.930
♪ My daylight flight ♪

00:43:42.440 --> 00:43:42.550
have taught me

00:43:42.550 --> 00:43:43.820
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

00:43:43.820 --> 00:43:45.220
another way to live.

00:43:45.220 --> 00:43:47.050
♪ Boundless, endless ♪

00:43:47.320 --> 00:43:47.500
May we all find

00:43:47.500 --> 00:43:48.630
♪ Can barely breathe ♪

00:43:48.630 --> 00:43:50.130
the orbit that belongs to us,

00:43:50.130 --> 00:43:51.170
♪ Sinking to the seabed ♪

00:43:51.170 --> 00:43:52.310
and bravely share
our own light with the world.

00:43:52.310 --> 00:43:54.510
♪ I don't know ♪

00:43:55.120 --> 00:43:56.380
♪ Why ♪

00:43:56.380 --> 00:43:57.530
I'm Lin Zhixia.

00:43:58.420 --> 00:44:01.380
Thank you for listening to my world.

00:44:15.500 --> 00:44:21.720
[The End]